# Build context of processor, analytics and bot is the repo root, so that their
# Dockerfiles can copy shared/bridge_shared (see shared/bridge_shared/__init__.py). Send
# only what they read: on the server the root also holds .env, backups/ (pg_dump files)
# and wa-service's node_modules — none of it belongs in a build context.
# wa-service builds from ./wa-service and does not see this file.
*
!shared/
!processor/
!analytics/
!bot/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.venv
